    2181   00:4C95  C3 8E 4C                jp  PRINTHL
    2182   00:4C98                      
    2183   00:4C98                      ; Routine to print the string addressed by HL on a line, if exceeding it, ends with ..
    2184   00:4C98                      PRINTHLINE:
