    4493   00:57F5  FE 12                   cp 18                           ; Is response of our command?
    4494   00:57F7  20 ED                   jr  nz,TCPIP_TCP_RCV_ST1
    4495   00:57F9                          ; At this point, all data is being buffered, so 15 ticks, quarter second, is more than enough time-out
    4496   00:57F9  F3                      di
    4497   00:57FA  21 1E 00                ld  hl,30
    4498   00:57FD  CD 15 5A                call    SETCOUNTER
    4499   00:5800  FB                      ei
    4500   00:5801                          ; now get return code, if return code other than 0, it is finished
