    4849   00:5995                      
    4850   00:5995                      ;--- Get slot connected on page 1 and test if work area has been created, if not, create it
    4851   00:5995                      ;    Input:  -
    4852   00:5995                      ;    Output: A = Slot number
    4853   00:5995                      ;    Modifies: AF, HL, E, BC
    4854   00:5995                      
