    4896   00:59CE                      
    4897   00:59CE                      ;--- Obtain slot work area (8 bytes) on SLTWRK
    4898   00:59CE                      ;    Input:  A  = Slot number
    4899   00:59CE                      ;    Output: HL = Work area address
    4900   00:59CE                      ;    Modifies: AF, BC
    4901   00:59CE                      
    4902   00:59CE                      GETWRK:
