    4945   00:59FE                      
    4946   00:59FE                      ;--- Obtain the address where our memory area address in high memory is stored
    4947   00:59FE                      ;    Input:  A  = Slot number
    4948   00:59FE                      ;    Output: HL = High memory area address
    4949   00:59FE                      ;    Modifies: AF, BC
    4950   00:59FE                      
    4951   00:59FE                      GETMEMPOINTER:
